            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Hải Sản Nhấp Nháy",
            "review_text": "Dao T\n13 contributions\n0\nVery satisfied\nJan 2025 • Friends\nWe chose this restaurant to eat me and watch the football match. They have quite nice rooms and the seafood has many different types. I was really attracted by the lobster and king crab bowls. I have never seen such a variety anywhere. They prepare it quite quickly and it is delicious.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 2, 2025",
