            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Hải Sản Nhấp Nháy",
            "review_text": "Sunnytravel\n11 contributions\n0\nexcelent restaurant\nDec 2024 • Friends\nSeafood restaurant near the beautiful beach of Da Nang. The restaurant is not fancy but very nice and airy. There are tables in private rooms and tables outside overlooking the sea. The seafood farming area is right next to the entrance, with many tanks of different types of seafood such as lobsters, king crabs, snails of all kinds, fish... in general, there is nothing missing.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 27, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
