            "review_text": "TINA SPA\n8 contributions\n0\nThey then process it and offer it to us. Must admit, it was great.\nDec 2024 • Friends\nI was a little worried about coming here because the restaurant is in the tourist area, close to the beach, and I was worried about the price. But when you come, you can't leave because seafood is so tempting. We finally decided to eat here. Hospital staff came over to introduce different kinds of seafood and suggest how to make them. We picked out some affordable items.\nThey then process it and offer it to us. Must admit, it was great.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten December 7, 2024",
