            "review_text": "moon B\nDa Nang, Vietnam20 contributions\n0\nVery pleased with everything\nDec 2024 • Friends\nOur driver brought us here for lunch and we were very surprised at the seafood here. There are a lot of varieties, with lobster, king crab, bull, fish, etc.\nThey asked us to choose seafood grown in tanks, the price is listed in Vietnamese Shields. We finally chose the dishes we thought reasonable. Then they invited us to sit and wait at the table. They handled it quickly and put it on the sidewalk so we could observe how they handled seafood.\nFinally the food came out, and it was hot and delicious.\nVery pleased with everything\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten December 6, 2024",
